+        // What this test can and cannot show. It can show that the *guard predicate* accepts a Done
+        // pane: its refusal has one message and that message must not appear. It cannot show the
+        // queued submission landing, because `queue_agent_prompt` then checks that the provider is
+        // the pane's foreground process and no provider runs here — faking one to get past that is
+        // the workaround this round is not taking. That last step is what the live run covers.
+        const REFUSED: &str = "is not the observed ready state";
